SUMMARY:African Textiles at the Ackland II
DESCRIPTION:This program is now FULL. To be added to our WAITLIST\, please email acklandRSVP@unc.edu. \n  \nArtist and conservator Stacey L. Kirby discusses her work with textiles and costume and the treatments she completed on textiles on view in Continental Shift: Recent Acquisitions of African Art.  Free\, but space is limited; registration required below. \nThis event is part of UNC–Chapel Hill’s Campus Life Experience (CLE) program. Students who attend can scan the QR code provided at the event to receive CLE credit.
URL:https://events.ackland.org/event/nov1-african-textiles-at-the-ackland-ii/
