SUMMARY:Curator’s Tour of "Care and Concern"
DESCRIPTION:A guided look at art by Native American artists in Care and Concern: Recent Acquisitions of Modern and Contemporary Art with exhibition curator Lauren Turner\, associate curator for contemporary art. Free\, but space is limited; registration required below. \nThis event is part of UNC–Chapel Hill’s Campus Life Experience (CLE) program. Students who attend can scan the QR code provided at the event to receive CLE credit. \n 
